const pathFinderAi = {
  name: "PathFinder AI",
  greeting: "Hello! Welcome to Pathfinder. What can I do for you today?",
  rolePlay: () => {
    console.log(this.greeting); 
  }
};

pathFinderAi.rolePlay();
```


**Explanation:**

* **`pathFinderAi`**: This is the object that represents our AI character. 
* **`name`**: Stores the character's name as "Pathfinder AI". 
